## Filing new issues

The issue tracker is available through `list_issues`, `get_issue`,
`search_issues`, and `create_issue`. If testing reveals a new bug unrelated to
this issue, search for an existing report first, then file at most one `bug`
issue. Do not file performance suggestions; those belong to the performance
evaluator.

